PNG exports, derived from the SVGs — never drawn by hand, never the source of
truth. Regenerate from ../primary/, ../wordmark/ and ../mark/ when those change.

Expected, per lockup and treatment, on transparent ground:

  ga-logo@1x.png  ga-logo@2x.png  ga-logo@3x.png
  ga-logo-sand@1x.png   ... and so on for -navy, -white, -black
  ga-mark-512.png  ga-mark-256.png  ga-mark-64.png  ga-mark-32.png

Note: the SVG colour check does not read PNGs. A raster carrying the wrong
treatment's colours cannot be caught automatically — regenerate, do not edit.
